<title>AUSTRIA: Austria natbank allots 8.74 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria natbank allots 8.74 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 8.74 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements, or repo, at a fixed rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 10 percent of bids were filled.  </p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 5.42 billion schillings in repos at a rate of 3.20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 254</p>
